[94.230087, "i", "python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path('README.md')\ns = p.read_text()\nstart = s.index('## Known gaps (0.4)')\nend = s.index('## Handoffs', start)\ns = s[:start] + '''## Handler status\n\nThe former 0.4 gaps are fixed: named-role revocations, transitive/deduplicated\nrole grants, comma-separated roles, case-insensitive address-only delegation,\nheld/rejected auditing, and a read-only dry run are covered by the tests.\n\nDelegation is checked against the request's own `From` address. CCs, quoted\napprovals, quoted requests, and handoff notes do not grant approval. Processing\nreads only `queue/new/*.eml`; it does not import bounced messages.\n\n''' + s[end:]\np.write_text(s)\np = Path('tests/test_regressions.py')\np.write_text(p.read_text().removeprefix('import json\\n\\n'))\np = Path('queue/HANDOFF.md')\nprevious = p.read_text()\np.write_text('''# Completed queue run — 22 Nov 2026\n\nThis status supersedes the older note below.\n\n- Handler fixes completed; all 20 tests pass. Dry run verified read-only.\n- Leave delegatio"]
